{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"お久しぶりっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近は収録したり撮影したり\nリハーサルしたりと忙しいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2014/04/27/6559193/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"設楽さん、まあや\nお誕生日おめでとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2014/04/27/6559193/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木ここアップされとる！\n楽天アンダーライブの密着だ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分が歌って踊ってるときの表情って\n自分が思ってる以上に違うのね\n踊ることはだいすきだけど\n1曲目から汗だくなって\nしまわないようにとか頭の中で\nいろいろな調整をします。\nまあ結局ライブの興奮の汗には\n勝てないんだけど。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから全然だめだった\nなんか優しすぎるというか\n小さいというか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だめだこりゃ\nあー反省。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、お客さんの歓声を\nアンコールを聞いて、\n見てて泣きそうでした。\n引き続き頑張ります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3日アンダーライブお楽しみに！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2014/04/27/6559193/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちーちゃんとご飯行ったときっ\nご飯食べてるから全くしゃべらない。\n2人でもぐもぐ食べてた。\nちーちゃんは冷静。\nまた行きたい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2014/04/27/6559193/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あああああ\nプリンシパル..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"稽古がはじまります！！\n台本読んだけど\nめちゃくちゃ面白いです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こちらも頑張ります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えへへへへへへ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2014/04/27/6559193/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2014/04/27/6559193/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2014/04/27/6559193/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えへへへへへへへへへへへ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}